# Engine crate rules

- Workspace members: `core`, `sketch`, `solid`, `occt`, `wasm` — keep host-neutral semantics out of UI crates.
- OCCT FFI and native adapters stay in `crates/occt`.
- History/replay changes require tests under the owning crate.
- Avoid breaking `.nbcad` / DTO shapes without a migration note in the PR.
